      "applicability": "unresolved",
      "finding": "not_applicable","comment": "A conditional licence may be considered if the standard is met with a hearing aid. No data exists on whether the patient uses hearing aids or if they meet the standard aided."
    },
    {
      "source_slot": 2,
      "patient_paragraph": 0,
      "applicability": "unresolved",
      "finding": "not_applicable","comment": "The guideline notes that relying solely on vision to compensate for significant hearing loss is challenging in commercial vehicles. Without confirmed hearing thresholds or the use of aids, it is impossible to determine if this capacity exists."
    },
    {
      "source_slot": 3,
      "patient_paragraph": 0,
