      "finding": "not_applicable","comment": "The guideline states functional hearing is used for sensing alarms and vehicle technology alerts. Without audiometry, the ability to sense these cues cannot be assessed."
    },
    {
      "source_slot": 4,
      "patient_paragraph": 0,
      "applicability": "unresolved",
      "finding": "not_applicable","comment": "The guideline requires consideration of the nature of the driving task and information from an ENT specialist or audiologist. No such assessment or specific task details are provided."
    },
    {
      "source_slot": 5,
      "patient_paragraph": 0,
      "applicability": "unresolved",
      "finding": "not_applicable","comment": "The guideline requires the health professional to provide details of medical criteria not met and evidence of criteria met. No hearing-specific criteria have been established as met or not met."
    }
